L1: Acute beetroot juice supplementation improves exercise tolerance and cycling efficiency in adults with obesity
L2: Physiological Reports (2020)
L3: Christian E. Behrens, Khandaker Ahmed, Karina Ricart, Braxton Linder, José Fernández, Brenda Bertrand, Rakesh P. Patel, Gordon Fisher
L4: 1 
L5:  Department of Nutrition Sciences 
L6:  The University of Alabama at Birmingham 
